<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42933" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑσπερ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
		pecul. fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑσπέριος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>western,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλμη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					6.219
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst., <i>night-scented stock, Matthiola tristis,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				6.17.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				21.39
			</span></i> ; =
			<i>citreum,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> as pr. n., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑσπερίδες, αἱ,</span>
			<i>the Hesperides, daughters of Night,</i> who dwelt in an island,
				<i>on the western verge of the world,</i> and guarded a garden
			with golden apples, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				215
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				742
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				4.27
			</span></i>, etc.: hence 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑσπερίδων μῆλα</span>”
				<i>quinces,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pamphil.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				2.82d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑ. νῆσοι,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κασσιτερίδες</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.P.
				563
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
